WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 11.18 · Fundraising, Revenue & Sustainable Business Models
Budgets for proposals

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Build proposal budgets from real costs, in the funder’s format and rules.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start from your project costing, not a round number.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check eligible costs, indirect cap, match and currency.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Link every line to an activity, and check the sums.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Pan del Barrio: US$12,000 for 12 training places; no indirect costs allowed, so rent stays with the business.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You adapt one project budget to a funder’s rules.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
